# Frontend (Vite) environment variables.
# Copy to `.env.local` and edit; .env.local is git-ignored by Vite.

# URL of paslite-server (apps/server). Leave unset to run the
# cockpit in local-only mode (default; existing deployments are
# unaffected).
#
# When set, the cockpit:
#   - replays the active submission's audit log from the server on
#     startup, merging any events not yet in localStorage
#   - posts every new audit event to the server, batched (~200ms
#     debounce) for amortised request cost
#   - shows a connection indicator in the TopBar (synced / syncing
#     / offline / error)
#
# Run the server first:
#   cd apps/server && npm install && npm run dev
#
# Then uncomment and set:
# VITE_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3001
